# Drift demo — a clean 10-second README GIF.
#
# Record with: vhs demo.tape
# Night pond, one palette crossfade, then the breathing guide.

Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 960
Set Height 540
Set Theme {"background": "#0E1420"}
Set Shell "bash"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms

Type "drift --hour 22"
Enter
Wait 4s

# Crossfade to the next palette
Press p
Wait 3s

# Show the breathing guide
Press b
Wait 3s

Press Esc
Wait 500ms
